# Out-of-Unity .NET verification harness (project files ARE tracked; outputs are not)
!/Tools/DotNet/**/*.csproj
!/Tools/DotNet/**/*.sln
/Tools/DotNet/**/bin/
/Tools/DotNet/**/obj/
/Tools/DotNet/TestResults/

